		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ghostly green apparition, refugee from the Negative Energy Plane. Seeks a willing host to harbor its essence.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 11, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +2 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Incorporeal</strong>. In place of attacks, become corporeal or incorporeal.</p><p></p><p><strong>Merge</strong>. Can absorb into a willing host, sharing memories and knowledge. Once absorbed by host, no longer considered undead.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
